<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="pt-br" xmlns:th="http://www.thymeleaf.org"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Imprimir senha</title><link rel="stylesheet" th:href="@{/css/app.css}"><style>.ticket-print{max-width:360px;margin:32px auto;text-align:center;padding:24px;border:1px dashed #777}.ticket-code{font-size:56px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:3px;margin:16px 0}.ticket-meta{font-size:14px;line-height:1.7}@media print{@page{size:80mm auto;margin:5mm}.ticket-print{border:0;margin:0;max-width:none;padding:0}.ticket-code{font-size:48px}}</style></head><body><main class="ticket-print"><h2>Hospital Smart</h2><p>Senha de atendimento</p><div class="ticket-code" th:text="${senha.codigo}">N001</div><div class="ticket-meta"><div th:text="${senha.tipo}">NORMAL</div><div th:if="${senha.nivelRisco != null}">Risco: <strong th:text="${senha.nivelRisco}"></strong></div><div th:if="${senha.paciente != null}" th:text="${senha.paciente.nome}"></div><div th:text="${#temporals.format(senha.emitidaEm,'dd/MM/yyyy HH:mm')}"></div><div th:if="${senha.guiche != null}">Guichê: <strong th:text="${senha.guiche}"></strong></div></div><p>Guarde esta senha e acompanhe a chamada.</p><div class="no-print"><button type="button" class="btn primary" data-print>Imprimir</button> <a class="btn secondary" th:href="@{/fila-senhas}">Voltar</a></div></main><script th:src="@{/js/impressao.js}"></script></body></html>